  "description": "“...How did you know I was here?”\n“You really think I just left you alone all this time because I couldn’t find you?”\n\nWhile struggling under the weight of her uncle’s debt, Heesu worked at a café during the day and a bar at night.\n\nThen, one day, Seokhyun—the ex-boyfriend she broke up with seven years ago—suddenly appeared before her.\n\nTo Heesu, who was always drowning in financial troubles, Seokhyun made an offer she couldn’t refuse.\n\n“There’s no way I can pay off that debt in my lifetime.”\n“So what? Are you saying you’re willing to offer your body instead?”\n“If that’s enough for you.”\n\nEven though she knew she shouldn’t, the moment she took his hand,\nthe relentless fate that had ended seven years ago was set to repeat itself.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3093000726), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8795528), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000053788), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/bad_suggestion_19), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/61211095)  \nR15: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3093000709), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8789196), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000053785), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/bad_suggestion_15), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Badpropose/), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/60087827)",
